    "Description": "The MariaDB Native Client library (C driver) is used to connect applications developed in C/C++ to MariaDB and MySQL databases. \n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* mariadb: MariaDB server: SQL injection vulnerability via improper handling of big5 character set with mysql_real_escape_string() (CVE-2026-44172)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
